      "writtenOn": "2024-02-22T22:19:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need a full spec from Realtek that explains all the fields. For Realtek, they set the connector number to 0 but this is an error in the UCSI spec. And pdr_t struct doesn\u0027t know about connector numbers.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1942,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 1942,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "6c761ab807620cdff7a6a0fb678a3361f1c547de",
